{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很喜欢对方，也舍不得这段亲近，想听到对方保证以后不变，却已经开始担心幸福不能一直持续。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、依恋、幸福、患得患失、隐隐疼痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"从怕给对方添负担转为怕对方不再需要自己；想收回心意反而更难受；幸福中掺入悲伤；脚步停住、声音下坠如叹息的具体画面。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正在享受和对方的亲近，却越来越害怕这份关系不能长久，想要确认对方会一直需要自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、舍不得、甜蜜、不安、害怕失去\",\n      \"missed\": \"他已经不像最初那样能装作不在乎；表达心意与隐藏心意之间的矛盾；幸福和悲伤交织的变化，以及最后脚步与下坠声音的意象。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他刚刚感受到亲近带来的幸福，就开始担心有一天对方不再需要自己，无法安心享受当下。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、心动、依恋、焦虑、沉重\",\n      \"missed\": \"他曾经害怕自己的需要成为对方的负担，如今害怕失去被需要的位置；往回隐藏喜欢反而更痛；刚得到幸福又发现留不住，以及声音像叹息般不断下沉的画面。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"正文虽然字号大、对比强，但整整九行都是同等醒目的连续长段，没有清晰的扫读入口，人物处境、心理转折和结尾画面挤在同一层级。右侧八条短语虽然提供了提炼，但数量偏多、字号偏小，彼此争夺注意力；尤其“先不猜以后了”与正文反复追问“真能一直这样吗”“可是呢？”的心理状态不完全一致。正文的情绪因果本身是连贯的，但扫读时容易只抓到喜欢、幸福、害怕失去几个词，难以迅速抓住从幸福到患得患失、再到不愿隐藏心意的完整变化。下方音符动画有视觉节奏，但与脚步停住、声音下坠的文字意象没有形成明确对应。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3be663ab-32cb-4d59-bb7d-368c90580b14", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010209520190Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:03:45.000325+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f8be392b79684ec8d89cd27b540ba7962e8bb2cb465ce8f8aa2f6dc63c385b2", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010209520190Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "297fc6748500a6d4e39e84307c6fadc12708863a63775e43c43172b5aaf40e0a"}}}
